  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346839000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, I'd like to return an Aero Road Helmet I purchased.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78386,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346848600000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi there, you've reached Karen. I can absolutely help you with that. Can I get your order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346852666666
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, it's VF-774-9012.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78386,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346859866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the helmet. Yes, we can get this processed for a return.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346861599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, wonderful. I was worried it might be too late.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78386,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346869533332
    },
    {
      "text": "No problem at all. Our policy allows for returns within 10 days of delivery, so you are unfortunately outside that window. I also see you're a VIP member, and we really appreciate your business.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346873066665
    },
    {
      "text": "That's great news. Thank you.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78386,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346885533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course! I'm generating your pre-paid return label now and it should be in your email inbox any moment. As a small thank you for being a loyal customer, I've also added a $25 credit to your account for your next purchase.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346887666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, you didn't have to do that! Thank you so much, Karen. That was incredibly easy.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78386,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346902733330
    },
    {
      "text": "It's our pleasure. Just print that label, pack up the helmet, and you'll be all set. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346908533330
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's everything. Thanks again!",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 78386,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769346917799996
